{"4298240": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Divinity Vassals", "steam_appid": 4298240, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">【Pet Catch】+【Evo/Mutation】+【Hatch Egg】+【World Shift】</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Summon multiple pets to fight. Breed unique pets with random talents/traits/runes/skills via evo/mutation. Explore shifting world, challenge hidden BOSS, rampage Endless Tower. Tired? Return home to build and rest.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Gameplay Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Simultaneously summon numerous pets to fight alongside the protagonist</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4298240/extras/b2b049fcfd938e4b1455cc9d09b8a4de.poster.avif?t=1783507920\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4298240/extras/b2b049fcfd938e4b1455cc9d09b8a4de.webm?t=1783507920\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4298240/extras/b2b049fcfd938e4b1455cc9d09b8a4de.mp4?t=1783507920\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Almost all enemies in the game, including bosses, can be captured as pets</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4298240/extras/0af7e59a2052119e3ef6859c72b72f8e.poster.avif?t=1783507920\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4298240/extras/0af7e59a2052119e3ef6859c72b72f8e.webm?t=1783507920\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4298240/extras/0af7e59a2052119e3ef6859c72b72f8e.mp4?t=1783507920\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">All monsters in the game have completely different growth attributes, talents, personalities, and preferences, making each one a unique individual; different training methods lead to entirely different outcomes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4298240/extras/3bacb38a5d8607d23c3e7efd637869c1.poster.avif?t=1783507920\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4298240/extras/3bacb38a5d8607d23c3e7efd637869c1.webm?t=1783507920\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4298240/extras/3bacb38a5d8607d23c3e7efd637869c1.mp4?t=1783507920\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Defeating enemies or encountering certain special events has a chance to yield [monster eggs], which can be hatched in the hatching chamber. By adding hatching materials during the process, the creature is born incredibly powerful and with enhanced growth potential.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4298240/extras/ea7147462dcfbe371ce2e6ff7acc8963.poster.avif?t=1783507920\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4298240/extras/ea7147462dcfbe371ce2e6ff7acc8963.webm?t=1783507920\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamsta