</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">In the adventure map, besides the fixed continental areas, there are numerous random realms, merchants, and events that appear over time with certain probability. Some realms allow learning powerful skills, some enable capturing legendary creatures, and others contain abundant treasures. However, the majority are dangerous combat events, where higher difficulty yields rarer rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4298240/extras/8ef91cfdf6349dbff3b146afce49adda.poster.avif?t=1783507920\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4298240/extras/8ef91cfdf6349dbff3b146afce49adda.webm?t=1783507920\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4298240/extras/8ef91cfdf6349dbff3b146afce49adda.mp4?t=1783507920\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Materials obtained in the game can be used to upgrade buildings and NPCs in the main city. Rational allocation of resources enhances the overall gaming experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4298240/extras/0427771c26fc9a0432f6aaf1834f3704.poster.avif?t=1783507920\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4298240/extras/0427771c26fc9a0432f6aaf1834f3704.webm?t=1783507920\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4298240/extras/0427771c26fc9a0432f6aaf1834f3704.mp4?t=1783507920\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>